					 &lt;BR&gt; 
7. The unaudited consolidated financial results of Anand Rathi Share and Stock Brokers Limited are also available on the Company's website, www.anandrathi.com and on the stock exchange website www.nseindia.com and www.bseindia.com.				 &lt;BR&gt; 
					 &lt;BR&gt; 
